# An allow-list: nothing ships unless named here (IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN 0.2.5). A deny-list let
# review scratch, notes, logs and a junction to the firmware sources into the package.
#
# Releases are built per platform by `npm run package:vsix` (scripts/package-vsix.cjs), which
# stages these same files with the native modules and the Windows pairing helper and checks the
# result. This file only keeps a plain `vsce package` from shipping the repository.
